            "review_title": "Review at Viet A Restaurant",
            "review_text": "GoldCoast91\nGold Coast, Australia79 contributions\n1\nLovely Authentic Vietnamese food\nAug 2019 • Couples\nWe were out and about looking for our new go to weekly Vietnamese restaurant which would be close to where we are staying and at a reasonable price. Come across this little gem of a place. Very clean, some of the waitresses speak good English. Tried all the a few of the local foods like pancake, spring roll, noodle, bbq chilli squid. All cooked perfectly and very delicious !! \nThey also have Italian wine by the glass which is great as I’m not a beer drinker. \nWe will definitely be back.\nRead more\nWritten August 12, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-04",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
