            "review_title": "Review at Viet A Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Martin W\nLangenhagen, Germany20 contributions\n3\nExcellent insider restuarant\nApr 2019 • Couples\nIf you’re looking for an authentic quiet restaurant without tourist influence this is the place to eat!\nJust 5 minutes walk from the beach, a family run delicious traditional Vietnamese restaurant, with local prices.\nThe staff ( family ) are so friendly and they take much care in presenting the food on your plate.\nWe walked around the area for many hours , but a better restaurant with delicious specialities , here you will not find .\nWe strongly recommend you take the effort to explore the back streets and find this very well decorated , and friendly place to eat .\nRead more\nWritten April 18, 2019",
